# `.work/` is tracked on purpose since 2026-10-03 (owner decision): the plan
# corpus is the input of `pnpm run check:plan`, and a gitignored corpus left the
# corpus half of that gate unreachable everywhere but the author's machine
# (defect R-54). Only scratch stays out.
/.tmp/
/.pnpm-store/
/.dsh/
/.analysis/
/.forge/
# Archive snapshots of the workspace (e.g. DSH-MyWork.rar, 41 MB) must never be committed.
/*.rar
/*.zip
/*.7z
node_modules/
# Build output of the workspace packages only: a bare `lib/` would also hide
# `tests/lib/` and `scripts/lib/`, which are source.
packages/*/lib/
*.tgz

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/
*.gate.lock*
